  "short_description": "《生死難判》是一款殘酷的洞穴探險生存模擬遊戲。身為俘虜的玩家以取回遺失貨物的藉口，受指派前往一顆陌生的星球。你得深入探索星球 11 層的不同地景，用盡所有辦法在難以想像的惡劣環境生存下去。才知你不過是成千上萬被送到這裡來試死的實驗對象之一。",
  "short_description_en": "Casualties: Unknown is an unforgiving cave-exploration survival simulator. Your captors have tasked you with retrieving lost cargo on a foreign planet, explore its 11 layers and do your best to survive diverse hostile environments. You are just one of the thousands of test subjects sent to die.",
